      {
        "id": "sec_17834149312145",
        "type": "split-layout",
        "hidden": false,
        "data": {
          "content": {
            "heading": "THE GEOMETRY OF DRAPE",
            "italicHeading": "Form Following Feeling",
            "subheading": "",
            "description": "The foundation of the FW26 collection relies heavily on the tension between rigid structure and liquid drape. Our ateliers in Milan spent four months perfecting the shoulder line of the signature Aalto coat—ensuring it holds a severe architectural shape while allowing the body underneath to move with complete freedom.",
